<!--
  MileLog mark: the fuel drop with its amber band, taken from the original
  launcher icon (ic_launcher_foreground.xml) so the header and the home screen
  icon are the same object.

  Recoloured for the dark instrument bar. The drop is drawn in the chrome text
  tone and its core is punched out with the chrome surface, which is exactly how
  the launcher icon builds its ring. #101618 must stay equal to
  InstrumentSurface in Color.kt or a seam will show.
-->
